<title>TURKEY: Iraqi oil to be loaded at Monday ceremony - agency.</title>
<headline>Iraqi oil to be loaded at Monday ceremony - agency.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraqi oil is to be loaded onto a vessel at a ceremony in the southern Turkish port of Ceyhan on Monday in the presence of Prime Minister Necmettin Erbakan, Turkey's Anatolian news agency said.</p>
<p>Turkish oil officials have said the loading could begin at the weekend ahead of the ceremony.</p>
</text>
